flowchart TD
  %% Stripe integration flow for this Rails project
  Start([Start]) --> ClickConnect[User clicks Connect Stripe in Dashboard]

  ClickConnect --> HasAccount{User has stripe_account_id?}
  HasAccount -- No --> CreateAccount[Backend: create Stripe Account via API]
  CreateAccount --> SaveAccount[Save stripe_account_id on User record]
  HasAccount -- Yes --> UseExisting[Use existing stripe_account_id]

  SaveAccount --> GenerateAccountLink
  UseExisting --> GenerateAccountLink

  GenerateAccountLink[Backend: create Account Link for onboarding] --> RedirectOnboarding[Redirect user to Stripe Onboarding]

  RedirectOnboarding --> OnboardingStatus{User completes onboarding?}
  OnboardingStatus -- Yes --> WebhookAccountUpdated[Stripe webhook account.updated received]
  OnboardingStatus -- No --> ReturnToApp[User returned without completing onboarding]

  WebhookAccountUpdated --> CheckCapabilities{charges_enabled and payouts_enabled?}
  CheckCapabilities -- Yes --> EnableAccount[Mark user as stripe_charges_enabled and stripe_payouts_enabled]
  CheckCapabilities -- No --> ShowPending[Notify user of required actions]

  EnableAccount --> Connected[User Stripe account ready to accept payments]

  %% Checkout flow
  Connected --> ChooseProduct[Customer chooses product or number of stores]
  ChooseProduct --> CreateCheckout[Backend: create Stripe Checkout Session]
  CreateCheckout --> RedirectCheckout[Redirect customer to Stripe Checkout]

  RedirectCheckout --> PaymentOutcome{Payment outcome}
  PaymentOutcome -- paid --> WebhookPayment[Stripe webhook checkout.session.completed]
  PaymentOutcome -- requires_action --> WebhookAsync[Handle async payment or pending PIX]
  WebhookPayment --> FulfillOrder[Update order, grant resources, save receipt]
  WebhookAsync --> FulfillOrder

  FulfillOrder --> Notify[Send confirmation email and optional WhatsApp message]
  Notify --> End([End])

  %% Environment and webhook notes
  subgraph Config
    SK[ENV STRIPE_SECRET_KEY]
    SW[ENV STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET]
  end
  SK --> CreateAccount
  SK --> CreateCheckout
  SW --> WebhookAccountUpdated
  SW --> WebhookPayment

  classDef important stroke:#0b5fff,stroke-width:2px;
  class CreateAccount,CreateCheckout,WebhookPayment,WebhookAccountUpdated important;

